summary.label:
View moon phase information and check moonrise and moonset with operational changes right on your phone.

Subscription:
1、Users can only use the Moon Phase Viewer for unlimited times after paying the subscription fee;
2. The subscription fee will be deducted from the user's iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase. The subscription is free for three days and can be automatically renewed for $39.99/year;
3, the user can turn off the auto-renewal subscription 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4、Auto-renewal of subscription Apple ID, will be 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle, automatically deducted from the iTunes account and extend the corresponding validity period;
5、Users manage their subscription services, i.e., they can go to their user account settings to turn off automatic subscriptions after purchase.


